		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>merci de ta réponse,</p><p>httpd.conf ce termine par Include &quot;X:/SVR/wamp/alias/*&quot; et inclue donc:</p><p>Alias /phpmyadmin &quot;X:/SVR/wamp/apps/phpmyadmin3.3.9/&quot; <br />&lt;Directory &quot;X:/SVR/wamp/apps/phpmyadmin3.3.9/&quot;&gt;<br />&#160; &#160; Options Indexes FollowSymLinks MultiViews<br />&#160; &#160; AllowOverride all<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; Order Deny,Allow<br />&#160; &#160; Deny from all<br />&#160; &#160; Allow from 127.0.0.1<br />&lt;/Directory&gt;</p><p>Alias /phppgadmin &quot;X:/SVR/wamp/apps/phppgadmin5.0.2/&quot; <br />&lt;Directory &quot;X:/SVR/wamp/apps/phppgadmin5.0.2/&quot;&gt;<br />&#160; &#160; Options Indexes FollowSymLinks MultiViews<br />&#160; &#160; AllowOverride all<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; Order Deny,Allow<br />&#160; &#160; Deny from all<br />&#160; &#160; Allow from 127.0.0.1<br />&lt;/Directory&gt;</p><p>j&#039;ai fait un copier/coller de l&#039;alias de myAdmin mais<br />localhost:8080/phpmyadmin&#160; &#160; Ok<br />localhost:8080/phppgadmin&#160; &#160; Ko</p><p>étrange</p>]]></content>
